WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Just a word of warning, but the&nbsp;
more you make homemade treats,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.320
the more you crave them. These are my chocolate&nbsp;
krispie treats that I grew up eating, but now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.520
I've made one healthy cereal swap to increase&nbsp;
both the protein and fiber. As a dietician,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.680
I wish more people knew that you can&nbsp;
upgrade your favorite childhood treats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.240
without needing to compromise on flavor. Just&nbsp;
three main ingredients, 5 minutes of prep,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:24.480
and I recommend doubling the batch because you're&nbsp;
going to want more. Let me know if you try them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.080
and don't forget to follow for more healthy&nbsp;
recipes from a [music] dietitian. Enjoy.

